{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c303f3cff994766c","x":60,"y":-332,"width":647,"height":162,"type":"text","text":"After the fall, you feel like you are in a completely different place, the air around you feels warmer, more welcoming. \nYou look upwards and the rupture where you fell from is no longer there.\nIn front of you lays a wooden door with some light coming from the small gaps between the frame"},
		{"id":"5af5117df3c4033e","x":-340,"y":-281,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"After fall"},
		{"id":"702d6d521f5cb7d7","x":60,"y":-66,"width":647,"height":126,"type":"text","text":"You open the door, the light coming from inside blinds you. It takes a moment for you to gather your senses. When you do you notice you are inside the tavern, people talking mugs clashing and the fireplace cracking. You hear an old dwarf call you"},
		{"id":"9999fb20529e412a","x":-340,"y":-33,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Open door"},
		{"id":"c50369557fb1b20e","x":-340,"y":300,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Barkeeper (Thorf Widehook)]] Greeting"},
		{"id":"70633ee92d5b05ef","x":60,"y":220,"width":647,"height":221,"type":"text","text":"- Come in, come in! Welcome to the Sleepy Mug! My my, you look like trampled rabbit. What happened to you lot?\n- You know what, me pa always told me to be kind to wanderers. You need not to worry about anything tonight, you may pass the night here, on the house. \n- (BRENNA PREPARE THA ROOMS WE HAVE GUESTS)\n- You must be thirsty here, enjoy the best flagon in the realm! (heal 2d4 + 2)\n- What do ya think?\n"},
		{"id":"c33808579b72c7df","x":820,"y":220,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Answer questions"},
		{"id":"0daec57688cdafda","x":1280,"y":-60,"width":375,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"On whats outside\n- There are some guards patrolling the lands, and there is talk of a nasty bandit gang causing ruckus, but fortunately it hasnt hit my door  "},
		{"id":"e7fafb9cc1744db7","x":820,"y":360,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Send them off"},
		{"id":"3fb7cdc198b2c384","x":780,"y":560,"width":331,"height":120,"type":"text","text":" Well lads choose any table!  I be with a in a minute with some bites to eat, make yourselves at home. "},
		{"id":"69a2cf8e050ab651","x":-340,"y":1180,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Soldiers]]"},
		{"id":"9322a993ff785f69","x":60,"y":1155,"width":250,"height":109,"type":"text","text":"Next to your table you see 3 soldiers wearing a red tabbard"},
		{"id":"9d4d514a14820e2c","x":457,"y":960,"width":250,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"Arth\nPart of [[Seraphim the lost]] party now working in guard duty"},
		{"id":"ac307866a6c2ea27","x":457,"y":1165,"width":250,"height":90,"type":"text","text":"Varden\nCity guard that dealt with [[Revenant gang]] "},
		{"id":"2fee9e5a58f9e03c","x":457,"y":1320,"width":250,"height":86,"type":"text","text":"Darian\nPatrol that found [[Nikolai Oak]]"}
	],
